e nineteenth-century and has since united a masterful link between past and present.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThe legend says that Princesse Adelaide d'Orléans, with her discerning taste, appreciated the art of fragrance, adorning herself with scents that complemented her noble presence. Quelques Fleurs Royale was to her the quintessential fragrance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eAs precious as a collection piece, discover Quelques Fleurs Royale in a small sized bottle (3ml). Experience the the explosion of florals with its luxurious oriental accord in its miniature version.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2024-03-20T15:27:19+01:00","created_at":"2023-11-21T14:44:20+01:00","updated_at":"2026-11-10T07:21:55+01:00","vendor":"Houbigant EU","product_type":"","tags":[],"variants":[{"id":48820784628038,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"54006-50","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"25.00","grams":0,"compare_at_price":null,"position":1,"product_id":8691155173702,"created_at":"2023-11-21T14:44:20+01:00","updated_at":"2026-11-10T07:21:55+01:00"}],"images":[{"id":53151674433862,"created_at":"2023-11-21T14:45:00+01:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2023-11-21T14:45:03+01:00","product_id":8691155173702,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0519\/8308\/9817\/files\/QFR2000X2000.jpg?v=1700574303","width":2000,"height":2000},{"id":53151674073414,"created_at":"2023-11-21T14:45:00+01:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2023-11-21T14:45:02+01:00","product_id":8691155173702,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0519\/8308\/9817\/files\/QFRMiniature.jpg?v=1700574302","width":2000,"height":2000}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":8691114180934,"title":"Quelques Fleurs L'Original Collection Privée Miniature","handle":"quelques-fleurs-loriginal-collection-privee-miniature","body_html":"\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eAn iconic classic in its own rite, Quelques Fleurs L’Original is a true ingenious scent of its time. The French perfumer, Robert Bienaimé, unveiled Quelques Fleurs the first true multi-floral blend ever created, in 1912.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eAs precious as a collection piece, experience the legendary Quelques Fleurs L'Original in this enchanting small size (3ml). A unique piece of the Maison to be added to your collection.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2024-03-20T15:24:50+01:00","created_at":"2023-11-21T14:11:18+01:00","updated_at":"2026-11-10T07:21:55+01:00","vendor":"Houbigant EU","product_type":"","tags":[],"variants":[{"id":48820683014470,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"84006-50","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"25.00","grams":0,"compare_at_price":null,"position":1,"product_id":8691114180934,"created_at":"2023-11-21T14:11:18+01:00","updated_at":"2026-11-10T07:21:55+01:00"}],"images":[{"id":53151552471366,"created_at":"2023-11-21T14:36:32+01:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2023-11-21T14:36:35+01:00","product_id":8691114180934,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0519\/8308\/9817\/files\/QFO2000X2000.jpg?v=1700573795","width":2000,"height":2000},{"id":53151556272454,"created_at":"2023-11-21T14:36:45+01:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2023-11-21T14:36:48+01:00","product_id":8691114180934,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0519\/8308\/9817\/files\/QFOMiniature.jpg?v=1700573808","width":2000,"height":2000}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":8691157008710,"title":"Quelques Fleurs Jardin Secret Collection Privée Miniature","handle":"quelques-fleurs-jardin-secret-collection-privee-miniature","body_html":"\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eQuelques Fleurs Jardin Secret represents a contemporary olfactory reinterpretation of a stunning garden—fascinating, mesmerizing, and abundant with white floral notes, where a myriad of flowers blossoms in profusion. Created by one of the world’s most promising Italian noses, Luca Maffei; the perfume appeals to all ages, and all women that want a unique signature scent.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eAs precious as a collection piece, capture the essence of this secret garden encapsulated in a small sized bottle (3ml). A singular masterpiece waiting to join your cherished collection.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2024-03-20T15:23:22+01:00","created_at":"2023-11-21T14:46:12+01:00","updated_at":"2026-11-10T07:21:55+01:00","vendor":"Houbigant EU","product_type":"","tags":[],"variants":[{"id":48820788494662,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"88006-50","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"25.00","grams":0,"compare_at_price":null,"position":1,"product_id":8691157008710,"created_at":"2023-11-21T14:46:12+01:00","updated_at":"2026-11-10T07:21:55+01:00"}],"images":[{"id":53151703302470,"created_at":"2023-11-21T14:47:04+01:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2023-11-21T14:47:07+01:00","product_id":8691157008710,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0519\/8308\/9817\/files\/QFJS2000X2000.jpg?v=1700574427","width":2000,"height":2000},{"id":53151702942022,"created_at":"2023-11-21T14:47:04+01:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2023-11-21T14:47:06+01:00","product_id":8691157008710,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0519\/8308\/9817\/files\/QFJSMiniature.jpg?v=1700574426","width":2000,"height":2000}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":8691158319430,"title":"Mon Boudoir Collection Privée Miniature","handle":"mon-boudoir-collection-privee-miniature","body_html":"\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eOriginated by Master Perfumer Robert Bienaimé in 1919, it was Queen Marie of Romania favourite fragrance. In honor of its centennial, the House of Houbigant has revived this unmatched fragrance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eAn emblem of undeniable femininity and elegance, Mon Boudoir has been created for the women of today, who embrace their power, free themselves from stereotypes and redefine the meaning of success.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eAs precious as a collection piece, carry a century of elegance with Mon Boudoir in a precious small sized bottle (3ml). An exclusive miniature addition to your collection of Houbigant fragrances.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2024-03-20T15:19:46+01:00","created_at":"2023-11-21T14:47:40+01:00","updated_at":"2026-11-10T07:21:55+01:00","vendor":"Houbigant EU","product_type":"","tags":["women"],"variants":[{"id":48820790427974,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"91006-50","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"25.00","grams":0,"compare_at_price":null,"position":1,"product_id":8691158319430,"created_at":"2023-11-21T14:47:40+01:00","updated_at":"2026-11-10T07:21:55+01:00"}],"images":[{"id":53151712706886,"created_at":"2023-11-21T14:47:47+01:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2023-11-21T14:47:50+01:00","product_id":8691158319430,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0519\/8308\/9817\/files\/MBD2000X2000.jpg?v=1700574470","width":2000,"height":2000},{"id":53151713952070,"created_at":"2023-11-21T14:47:55+01:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2023-11-21T14:47:58+01:00","product_id":8691158319430,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0519\/8308\/9817\/files\/MBDMiniature.jpg?v=1700574478","width":2000,"height":2000}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":8691159007558,"title":"La Belle Saison Collection Privée Miniature","handle":"la-belle-saison-collection-privee-miniature","body_html":"\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eA sumptuous floral bouquet, La Belle Saison captures the radiance of a spring day, as daylight extends, offering the promise of beautiful tomorrows.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eLa Belle Saison is an historic name of the House of Houbigant; the perfume was created in 1925, presented in a crystal bottle signed by René Lalique. \u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eRevisited in 2020 by Master Perfume Celine Ellena in the image of spring femininity: the one that we discover on the wonderful paintings of Botticelli. Grace, elegance and voluptuousness: a sensuality that is revealed with each gesture. A seductive sillage, an unparalleled signature.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eAs precious as a collection piece, discover La Belle Saison in a small sized bottle (3ml). Experience the gentle embrace of this exquisite blend in its miniature version.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2024-03-20T15:18:20+01:00","created_at":"2023-11-21T14:48:23+01:00","updated_at":"2026-11-10T07:21:55+01:00","vendor":"Houbigant EU","product_type":"","tags":[],"variants":[{"id":48820791968070,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"92006-50","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"25.00","grams":0,"compare_at_price":null,"position":1,"product_id":8691159007558,"created_at":"2023-11-21T14:48:23+01:00","updated_at":"2026-11-10T07:21:55+01:00"}],"images":[{"id":53151722832198,"created_at":"2023-11-21T14:48:35+01:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2023-11-21T14:48:37+01:00","product_id":8691159007558,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0519\/8308\/9817\/files\/LBS2000X2000.jpg?v=1700574517","width":2000,"height":2000},{"id":53151722930502,"created_at":"2023-11-21T14:48:35+01:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2023-11-21T14:48:38+01:00","product_id":8691159007558,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0519\/8308\/9817\/files\/LBSMiniature.jpg?v=1700574518","width":2000,"height":2000}],"options":[{"name":"Title","position":1,"values":["Default Title"]}]},{"id":8691158024518,"title":"Essence Rare Collection Privée Miniature","handle":"essence-rare-collection-privee-miniature","body_html":"\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eCrafted by Master Perfumer Jean Claude Ellena, Essence Rare is a soft floral symphony that captivates with the enchanting beauty of its raw materials. Immerse yourself in this timeless fragrance, as the perfect companion for moments of subtle elegance and refined luxury.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003ePerfumer’s story: “In 1973, as a young perfumer, just arriving in New York, my first assignment was to create a fragrance for the House of Houbigant with the help of an American colleague. The House wanted a classic perfume “à la française”, the name would be unveiled later.’’\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eAs precious as a collection piece, encased in a delicate small sized bottle (3ml), Essence Rare miniature becomes a unique and indispensable addition to your Houbigant’s fragrance collection.\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2024-03-20T15:15:57+01:00","created_at":"2023-11-21T14:47:18+01:00","updated_at":"2026-11-10T07:21:55+01:00","vendor":"Houbigant EU","product_type":"","tags":[],"variants":[{"id":48820789936454,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"90006-50","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"25.00","grams":0,"compare_at_price":null,"position":1,"product_id":8691158024518,"created_at":"2023-11-21T14:47:18+01:00","updated_at":"2026-11-10T07:21:55+01:00"}],"images":[{"id":53151708381510,"created_at":"2023-11-21T14:47:29+01:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2023-11-21T14:47:32+01:00